# Lightless Evangel: "Whenever you sacrifice another creature or artifact, put a +1/+1 counter on this creature." Umbral Collar
# Zealot ("Sacrifice another creature or artifact: Surveil 1") is the outlet. Bot1 sacrifices the Mox Pearl (an artifact) and
# then the Memnite (an artifact creature): one counter each, 2/2 -> 4/4. Sacrificing the Evangel itself is "another" to
# the Zealot but not to the Evangel, so it triggers nothing (the stack is empty after it).

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Jet
Mox Pearl
Swamp
Mox Emerald
Lightless Evangel
Umbral Collar Zealot
Memnite
Island x13

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Emerald.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Memnite.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Swamp.Play
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Pearl.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Lightless Evangel.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Swamp.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Emerald.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Umbral Collar Zealot.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Umbral Collar Zealot.Activate
Bot1.Choose(Mox Pearl)
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Arrange(| Island)
? Bot1.Battlefield.Lightless Evangel.Counters.PlusOnePlusOne = 1
Bot1.Battlefield.Umbral Collar Zealot.Activate
Bot1.Choose(Memnite)
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Arrange(| Island)
? Bot1.Battlefield.Lightless Evangel.Counters.PlusOnePlusOne = 2
Bot1.Battlefield.Umbral Collar Zealot.Activate
Bot1.Choose(Lightless Evangel)
? Stack.Count = 1
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Arrange(| Island)

[Expect]
Bot1.Graveyard = Island; Lightless Evangel; Island; Memnite; Island; Mox Pearl
